<%- include('partials/head') %>
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-dot"></span> THE EVERYDAY, REIMAGINED</div><h1>Good things.<br>Great <span>everydays.</span></h1><p>Discover considered design, fresh finds, and the little upgrades that make life feel a little more you.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/products">Explore the collection <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a><a class="text-link" href="/categories">Find your thing <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></a></div><div class="hero-proof"><span class="proof-circle">✦</span><div><strong>Thoughtfully selected. Made to inspire.</strong><small>Fresh perspectives. Everyday essentials.</small></div></div></div><div class="hero-art" id="hero-art"><div class="hero-grid"></div><span class="art-caption">FORM / FUNCTION / FEELING</span><div class="hero-orbit"></div><img class="hero-fallback" src="/images/audio.svg" alt="Sculptural midnight blue headphones"><canvas id="hero-canvas" aria-label="Interactive floating headphone sculpture"></canvas><div class="floating-label"><span class="tiny-dot"></span> SOUND, REDEFINED.</div><a class="hero-product" href="/products?category=Electronics"><span>Find your frequency<small>Explore the sound collection</small></span><span class="round-link">↗</span></a><span class="art-index">01 — THE SOUND EDIT</span></div></section>
<section class="benefit-strip" aria-label="Shopping benefits"><span><i data-lucide="truck"></i> Free demo delivery ₹4,999+</span><span><i data-lucide="shield-check"></i> A secure shopping experience</span><span><i data-lucide="package-check"></i> Thoughtfully curated finds</span><span><i data-lucide="rotate-ccw"></i> Simulated easy returns</span></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">A WORLD OF GOOD FINDS</span><h2>Find your everyday.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/categories">All categories <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a></div><div class="category-grid"><% const icons = ['headphones','shirt','lamp-desk','gamepad-2','watch','book-open','dumbbell','sparkles']; categories.slice(0,8).forEach((category, i) => { %><a class="category-tile" href="/products?category=<%= encodeURIComponent(category.name) %>"><div><i data-lucide="<%= icons[i % icons.length] %>"></i></div><span><%= category.name %></span><small>Explore ↗</small></a><% }) %></div></section>
<section class="section collection-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE NEXORA EDIT</span><h2>On your radar.</h2><p>Good design. Great company. Your next favorite is here.</p></div><a class="pill-link" href="/products?sort=popular">Shop the edit <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a></div><div class="product-grid"><% products.forEach(product => { %><%- include('partials/card', { product }) %><% }) %></div><% if (!products.length) { %><div class="empty-state"><h3>The collection is on its way.</h3><p>Run the development seed to discover the demo catalog.</p></div><% } %></section>
<section class="editorial"><div><span class="eyebrow">LESS ORDINARY. MORE YOU.</span><h2>Make space<br>for something good.</h2><p>Objects that earn their place.<br>Discover the home & living collection.</p><a class="button light" href="/products?category=Home%20%26%20Living">Find your calm <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a></div><img src="/images/home.svg" alt="Original illustration of a sculptural table lamp" loading="lazy"></section>
<section class="section story-row"><div><span class="eyebrow">A DIFFERENT KIND OF COMMERCE</span><h2>Small details.<br>Better experiences.</h2></div><p>We believe shopping should feel considered, simple, and a little inspiring. NEXORA brings that idea to life through a student-built experience, with local sellers and entirely simulated purchases.<a class="text-link" href="/about">Get to know us <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a></p></section>
<section class="newsletter"><div><span class="eyebrow">GOOD THINGS, IN YOUR INBOX</span><h2>Stay a little curious.</h2><p>Try our local newsletter demo. No email will be sent.</p></div><form id="newsletter-form"><label class="sr-only" for="newsletter-email">Email address</label><input id="newsletter-email" type="email" required placeholder="Your email address"><button class="button" type="submit">Count me in <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></button></form></section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
